R-RG9 R-RG2 R-AD34 R-J3 R-J5 R-E6 (slice 225, Q601 items 1, 2, 3, 5): tln add with a short name and the default registry: the short-name read is the first registry request and has no answer: the run falls back to direct. Direct mode has no index of short names, so the command stops with exit 2 (the text of direct). Run 1: the warning, then the exit 2 message. Run 2 (--json): a run that fails after the fall back has the note in error.details.notes (item 5 of R-RG9).
